The scoped nesso_runtime.py adapter follows the original Nesso conditioning
and triangle-update evaluation order. Compressme adds temporary instance
wrappers, input/state checks, request-local reuse, and explicit matrix packing.
No upstream source tree is included in this package.

The single-chunk dispatch semantics in chunking.py follow the OpenFold utility
used by Nesso: Copyright 2021 AlQuraishi Laboratory, Apache License 2.0.
https://github.com/aqlaboratory/openfold
The general helper adds a guarded single-chunk path and retains an original
fallback supplied by the caller.

